  "name": "QBZ-03 Chinese Rifle 5.56x45 Export Version",
  "slug": "qbz-03-chinese-rifle-556x45-export-version",
  "teaser": "Chinese Rifle QBZ-03 chambered in 5.56x45mm ported from Insurgency : Sandstorm",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2865.webp",
  "downloads": 3962,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod introduces the <strong>QBZ-03</strong>, a Chinese-made conventional rifle chambered in 5.56×45mm, ported from <strong>Insurgency: Sandstorm</strong>.</p>\n<p>- Comes with modern, fictional SEK modification parts.</p>\n<p>- Fully modular: from standard infantry rifle to highly customized tactical platform.</p>\n<p>- Base animations adapted from the AKM set to fit the AR-style magwell.</p>\n<p>&gt; Update v1.2.0:</p>\n<p>&gt; Use the new <strong>SEK modification kit</strong> to unlock the rifle’s full potential.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8294-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8294-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" alt=\"8294-pasted-from-clipboard-png\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- Lightweight <strong>M-LOK handguard</strong> with multiple mounting slots.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Ergonomic pistol grip</strong> designed to prevent finger strain and sharp-edge cuts.</p>\n<p>- <strong>ACR-style stock</strong> — yes, it fits anything.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Ambidextrous fast mag release</strong> for quick reloads.</p>\n<p>- E<strong>rgonomic charging handle</strong> for improved handling.</p>\n<p>- <strong>AR-15 buffer tube adapter</strong> included to support alternate stock options.</p>\n<h4><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/4748-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/4748-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></strong></h4>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/4749-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/4749-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/4750-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/4750-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>&gt; <strong>SEK parts</strong> were created by the talented modeler <strong>YLdcmy</strong></p>\n<p>&gt; [Visit YLdcmy on ArtStation](<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.artstation.com/yldcmy\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.artstation.com/yldcmy</a>)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Unzip the downloaded files.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the mod folder into your SPT directory.</p>\n<p>3. Launch the game.</p>\n<p>4. Visit Mechanic’s shop or the Flea Market to find the QBZ-03 and its attachments.</p>\n<p>**Note for MPT/Fika users:**</p>\n<p>If you experience white textures or bundle errors:</p>\n<p>- Copy <code>/user/mods/Mass\\_QBZ03/Mass\\_QBZ03/bundles</code></p>\n<p>- Merge into <code>/user/cache/</code> under the matching folder.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- Please <strong>credit the author or source</strong> when reuploading or publicly sharing this mod.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Do not distribute files with the <code>.bundle</code> extension</strong> from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- Respect the original creators and contributors.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>Models, Textures, Sounds</strong>: New World Interactive (*Insurgency: Sandstorm*)</p>\n<p>- <strong>SEK Mod Parts</strong>: YLdcmy (3D Models &amp; Textures)</p>\n<p>- <strong>Shading Fixes, Adapter Modeling</strong>: Friends of the author</p>\n<p>- <strong>Porting, Texturing, Animation Tweaks, Coding</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft</a></p>\n<p>- <strong>Inspiration</strong>: SamSWAT’s weapon ports</p>\n<p>- <strong>Tooling &amp; SDK</strong>: EFT SDK Development Team</p></div></div></div>\n",
